{
 "version": 1,
 "comment": "Stage 1 level 1 play (A vs B in Dolphin; uses the Dolphin-side set step). Menus as opening.json. docs/HARNESS_DOLPHIN.md",
 "steps": [
  {
   "comment": "0: boot loader until the title (mode 1)",
   "wait": {
    "mode": 1
   },
   "timeout": 3000
  },
  {
   "comment": "1: title: START until the main menu (mode 2)",
   "press": [
    "START"
   ],
   "every": 30,
   "until": {
    "mode": 2
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "2: main menu: A on Hyrulean Adventure, then A on its START! button, until the file select (mode 3)",
   "press": [
    "A"
   ],
   "every": 30,
   "until": {
    "mode": 3
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "3: file select: wait for the 'create a file for this game on the Memory Card in Slot A?' prompt (state 7)",
   "wait": {
    "lbl_8053ADB0->mState": 7
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "4: move its cursor to Yes (field_0x114 0)",
   "press": [
    "LEFT"
   ],
   "every": 10,
   "until": {
    "lbl_8053ADB0->field_0x114": 0
   },
   "timeout": 300
  },
  {
   "comment": "5: A on Yes: state 8 writes the file, state 9 waits for the card",
   "press": [
    "A"
   ],
   "every": 10,
   "until": {
    "lbl_8053ADB0->mState": [
     8,
     9,
     10
    ]
   },
   "timeout": 300
  },
  {
   "comment": "6: until the card write is done ('file created' message, state 10)",
   "wait": {
    "lbl_8053ADB0->mState": 10
   },
   "timeout": 3000
  },
  {
   "comment": "7: the message closes by itself; wait for the file rows (state 5, picking a file)",
   "wait": {
    "lbl_8053ADB0->mState": 5
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "8: A on file 1, then A on its menu, until the stage loader (mode 4)",
   "press": [
    "A"
   ],
   "every": 30,
   "until": {
    "mode": 4
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "9: player count (mode 4): A on Single-Player Game (and on what follows) until the stage is chosen (stage 8, level 3)",
   "press": [
    "A"
   ],
   "every": 30,
   "until": {
    "stage": 8,
    "level": 3
   },
   "timeout": 1200
  },
  {
   "comment": "10: `set` step (fsaport docs/HARNESS.md): enter stage 1 level 1 instead of the opening, as fsaport's ?stage= does (mStage/mLevel and GameState 0x128/0x12C), and start it from RNG seed 12345 (seed_on_stage: applied when createModeScreen_80135020(7) builds the stage, before its actors spawn), so runs whose menus took different numbers of frames start the stage alike",
   "set": {
    "lbl_80529DEC.mStage_0x118": 1,
    "lbl_80529DEC.field_0x128": 1,
    "lbl_80529DEC.mLevel_0x11c": 1,
    "lbl_80529DEC.field_0x12c": 1,
    "seed_on_stage": 12345
   }
  },
  {
   "comment": "11: the stage loads",
   "wait": {
    "mode": 7,
    "stage": 1,
    "level": 1
   },
   "timeout": 3000
  },
  {
   "comment": "12: settle",
   "wait_reads": 300
  },
